<div class="about-block raised">
  <h2>Hi There!</h2>
  <p>We’re Set4Pets — a young, ambitious brand just getting started, but with a big vision. At our core, we want to bring real value to both people and their pets, while also caring for animals and the environment.</p>
  <p>Our very first product is a premium pet backpack: it works as a safe car seat with our Secure Position System, and it also features an expandable front section for extra space when you’re not driving. Plus, it comes with a detachable side bag that includes a bottle for food and water — making life on the go much easier.</p>
  <p>We know this is only the beginning, and we truly welcome feedback from our community. If you have ideas on how we can make the backpack even better, or suggestions for what products you’d love to see next, we’d be thrilled to hear from you.</p>
  <p>Set4Pets is here to grow with you — always with one goal in mind: to create useful, safe, and thoughtful products that make life better for pets and their people.</p>
</div>
